WEBVTT

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.540
I'm truly sorry for worrying all of you.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.470
I also hope you will forgive 
me for being unable

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.470
to speak to you in my own words for so long,

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.540
due to my illness.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.450
From now on, I would like to 
give my all to my duties.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.010
I hope you will support me in this endeavor.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.130
That was a magnificent 
speech, Lady Draconness.

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:38.370
I just gave them a little greeting.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:42.420
The fact that you were able to deliver 
your own words was more than enough.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:47.390
Though I must admit, I'm a bit sad that 
I won't have to speak for you any longer.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:53.330
Everyone's so happy just because 
my surgery was a success.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:54.690
But of course.

00:00:55.220 --> 00:01:00.810
Dr. Glenn said he wanted me 
to see where this city goes.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:05.320
I may have been looking at the world from 
the sidelines without realizing it.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:10.060
The city I created, the people 
who have gathered here...

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.540
I really knew nothing about them.

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:15.390
Where is Dr. Glenn?

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:18.510
He said that Lady Saphentite 
is under the weather,

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.190
so he would have to miss the ceremony.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:23.100
I see. Then I'll just have 
to go see him myself.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:26.440
To the clinic? What about the ceremony?

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:29.300
I only ask that everyone enjoys themselves.

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:31.640
I'm not holding back any longer.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.980
I'm going to do what I want.

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:37.480
Is that going too far?

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.370
I believe you should do what your 
heart desires, Lady Draconness.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.550
Yes.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:53.830
I'll show Dr. Glenn what happens when he 
brings a lonely little dragon out of her shell.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:06.230
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.980
Case 12         The City of Dragons' Doctor

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.980
How are you feeling, Sapphee?

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.810
It's rare for you to catch a cold,

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:34.600
but I did push you pretty hard 
for Lady Skadi's surgery.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.350
I'm sorry.

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:41.860
We should warm you up a bit more.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.610
Shall I bring you some hot wine?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.190
Sapphee, could I take a look in your mouth?

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:54.620
N-Noph!

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:57.890
I knew it. Something's going on in there.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:00.380
Now, open up for me.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.070
D-Docthor...

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:04.750
I-I can thake care uff this muhshelf.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:08.260
You seem to have forgotten that 
you're ill. Now, open up.

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:16.370
Docthor... Fease do hurrhy upff.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.290
I will.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.070
Oh, sorry.

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:27.630
<i>Her teeth seem fine.</i>

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:28.420
Stick out your tongue.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:37.660
Docthor Gwenn...

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.410
I think I've found the problem.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:43.430
This isn't a permanent fix, 
but honey has antibacterial properties.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.040
It works on canker sores.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:51.300
Sorry. I'm almost done.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.450
There we go. All done.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.550
Doctor... I appreciate that 
you do things delicately,

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:07.090
but that took far too long.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.960
My mouth is tired now.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:11.480
Sorry.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.080
Also...

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.920
Your face was so close to mine, 
it was embarrassing!

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:26.400
I-It's about time for my house call, 
so I'm going to head out.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.240
Make sure you just rest today.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:31.350
Don't take too many detours 
on your way back.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.340
I won't. Let's have dinner together.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.510
Can you fix it?

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:51.700
I can't say. The bearings seem to be shot.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.360
I can't believe the wheel just
came off without warning.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:57.240
Thankfully, Lady Draconness wasn't hurt,

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:00.010
but you need to take better 
care of that thing.

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:01.240
I'm terribly sorry.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.010
Hello.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:05.750
Dr. Glenn!

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:07.660
What brings you he—

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.620
Lady Skadi!

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:13.030
Now I don't have to come and 
find you. Let's go somewhere.

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.900
Huh? Go somewhere?

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.740
I'm talking about a tryst.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:19.280
No, Big Brother Glenn?

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.520
Big Brother?!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.350
Wha—

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.500
U-Um, but I have a house call to make...

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.620
Just for a little bit.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:27.140
I can't. I have a patient waiting for me.

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:28.300
Well, this is a problem.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.020
Lady Draconness, what are you doing?!

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:33.420
If you want to hug someone, 
you can hug me!

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:36.610
Why are you acting so lovey-dovey 
with Dr. Glenn, anyway?!

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.540
Well, he cured me.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.730
See?

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.780
That's so indecent! Lady Draconness!

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:48.810
Did that excite you, Dr. Glenn?

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.510
Well, did it excite you, Dr. Glenn?!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.010
No...

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.750
Are you saying it <i>didn't</i> 
excite you, Dr. Glenn?!

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:57.290
Lady Skadi, please button up.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:58.950
Okay, do it for me.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:06.030
Let's go play once you button 
me up, Big Brother Glenn!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:09.460
I must ask you to please stop 
calling me "Big Brother."

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.590
Please understand, Lady Draconness.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.640
I realize I said you may do as you please,

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:18.150
but I didn't mean that you could get 
in the way of Dr. Glenn's work.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:19.140
Okay...

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.530
I'm truly sorry, Lady Skadi. 
Maybe next time.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:24.290
Let's head back and rest for the day.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.050
Then again...

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:31.060
With that going on, we'll have to wait here 
a while until the next carriage arrives.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.600
Doctor, is something wrong?

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:38.070
Hey, Memé. Well, as you can see...

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.220
D-Do you have a moment?

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:47.990
I might be able to do something 
about this with the tools I have...

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.490
Really?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:56.330
So she's the one who made the suture 
needles used in Lady Draconness's surgery?

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.410
Yes. She worked herself to 
the bone to create those.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:03.240
It's fixed! We're good to go!

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:05.710
Y-You should be all set now.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:09.750
My father makes carriages, so I'm 
pretty confident in my skills.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.630
Thanks. You were a big help.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.850
Th-This is nothing.

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:18.300
It appears you've saved me again.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:19.480
Huh? Wha?

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:23.410
If it weren't for you, I might not 
be standing here right now.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:24.440
I thank you.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.310
Oh, no... It was nothing...

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:30.900
I-If I could fix this carriage and make 
those needles, anyone could have.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:34.210
In the end, I really didn't do 
anything. I really didn't...

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:38.210
D-Doctor, what kind of service is this? 
How much am I going to be billed later?

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:40.590
Um... I'm pretty sure you won't.

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:43.320
Kunai, give Dr. Glenn and Memé the item.

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:44.300
Right away.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.070
What item?

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:51.830
Something I received at the ceremony. 
It's a token of my thanks.

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.220
You should both accept it.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.220
See you later, Big Brother!

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.220
Give Lady Saphentite our regards!

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:03.230
Now that the wheel's fixed, 
the carriage is so light!

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:08.950
It's no wonder the carriage broke down 
if these two giant things were in it.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.050
What should we do with this wine?

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:13.230
I-I'll go ahead and take it.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:17.840
I can't drink it, but I'm sure the boss and 
everyone at the workshop will love it.

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:20.760
I'm sure Sapphee will enjoy it, too.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:24.070
But it's not like I can just roll it back.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:27.560
Oh, no! I have to go make my house call.

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.510
Sorry, Memé, but could you 
watch over the barrels?

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:33.240
Huh? Huh?! Me?!

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.410
I'll be back as soon as I'm done!

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.060
Wait! Doctor!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.050
Huh? Memé?

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:44.320
Whoa! Those barrels are huge! 
Are you gonna drink all that?

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:47.570
N-No! Th-These are, uh...

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:49.770
It would take a while to explain...

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.040
Oh, in that case, never mind.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:53.440
See ya later!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:11.180
For crying out loud, Arahnia, 
what are you doing here?

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:15.670
Aw, what's the harm in me lookin' 
after you when you're sick? Right?

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.670
The doctor's not here, either...

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.690
There, all done.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.650
I could've changed myself, you know.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:34.050
I'm feeling much better, anyway.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:36.480
Just let me help, would ya?

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.500
Besides, if you stayed in bed longer,

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.690
I'd have more opportunities 
to tease the doctor.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:45.450
Arahnia...

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:50.360
Ooh, scary. Goodness, 
you take me so seriously now.

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.830
Look who's talking.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.500
You've become so devoted.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:11:00.250
The doctor's gonna be back for dinner, right?

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.440
I bought some fixin's.
Let's prepare it together later.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:08.420
Indeed. I can't just stay in bed forever.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.940
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:12.010
Up we go.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.940
Is that all of them?

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.850
Yes. You've saved us.

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:21.900
I didn't know what we were going 
to do when that boulder fell.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.920
Thank you so much!

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:26.900
You can ask me to do a little 
thing like this any time.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:35.120
Lady Gigas, please partake in our village's 
harvest as a token of our gratitude.

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.520
Food?

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.500
Oh, I forgot!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:45.960
I got plenty of these from the mountains, 
so I brought them as a gift.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:49.350
I-Isn't that a bit much?

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.570
Hmm?

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:55.780
Why is this happening to me?

00:11:56.300 --> 00:12:00.520
I'm so shy! I want to fade into nothingness.

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:04.320
Nothing, nothing, nothing, nothing, no—

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.640
Sorry to keep you waiting, Memé!

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:04.900
...thing?!

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.570
You have some nerve leaving 
me with these, Doctor.

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:12.270
Though I'm sure you're in a great mood 
after being praised for your fine work

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:14.900
at your house call and being gifted 
expensive sweets or something...

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:16.960
Of course, someone like me 
just deserves to be left

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:17.160
Er, I'm not sure what you're 
talking about, but I'm sorry.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.420
on the side of the road to be stared 
down by judgmental glances.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:21.420
Anyway, don't worry. I found someone 
to transport the barrels for us.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.440
I'm just... I'm just...

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.810
That's not the issue here!

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:32.170
You summoned me, so here I am, Good Doctor!

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:35.800
Miss Tisalia, and Miss Kay and Miss Lorna.

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:36.810
Wait!

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.200
Why is there another barrel?!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:43.990
It was gifted to us by one of the 
arena's regulars on our way here.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.520
Are wine barrels just a hot 
commodity in Lindworm right now?

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:50.210
Oh, we received meat and 
vegetables as well, of course.

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:56.560
Seriously! That's not what I was asking!

00:12:57.550 --> 00:13:01.260
Now, Lorna, take good care of Miss Memé.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.620
Of course. I'll head over to the clinic soon.

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:07.020
Thanks for everything today, Memé!

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:10.000
I-I didn't really do anything...

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.720
Make sure you hold on tight!

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:15.640
Wait! Too fast! No!

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.970
I'm going to get vertigo again!

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:20.310
Lorna is working so hard.

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:22.550
Miss Memé looks like 
she's having so much fun.

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:25.920
I-I'm not sure if I'd call that fun...

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:30.390
But you truly are amazing, Doctor.

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:31.740
What do you mean?

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:34.500
No one else would have 
the gall to ask our lady

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.830
to personally transport something for them.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.000
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.120
Miss Tisalia was just the 
first person I thought of.

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.540
You don't need to worry.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.660
I'm honored that you're 
relying on me, Good Doctor.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.890
I don't have any matches today, anyway.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.800
Thank you very much.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:55.470
Besides, you're future family, Good Doctor.

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:57.520
It's only right that we help each other.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:58.370
What?

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:01.060
Then we should set a date for you 
two to discuss your engagement.

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:04.810
That's a very good point. 
We really should decide that at once.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:09.510
Let's see... Father should be back 
from his caravan next week...

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:12.910
M-Miss Tisalia, I appreciate your feelings,

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.710
but I'm not interested in 
engagements and such just yet...

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:19.220
Oh, you needn't worry about Sapphee.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:19.570
Huh?

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:24.180
Sapphee and I are rivals who 
swore we'd fight fair and square.

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.700
We are having a battle 
to the death to determine

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:29.240
who can truly win your heart, 
with no grudges allowed.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:31.920
You're a very lucky man, Doctor.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.290
Ah, Doctor!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:36.460
It's so good to see you, Doctor!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.980
It's Ms. Sirsa and her husband.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.980
He told me he wouldn't take any detours...

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.130
He was only making one house call, right?

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:53.470
I hope he hasn't been dragged 
into some kinda trouble again.

00:14:57.310 --> 00:15:01.730
Won't you be pesterin' the 
doctor if you worry too much?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:07.590
You should let him run around a bit and 
just set a web trap in his room, like me.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.090
How is that letting him run around?

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:14.130
I hope no one's hitting on him again.

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.570
You're gonna give yourself 
another fever worryin' so much.

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:21.590
I mean, Dr. Glenn is quite popular...

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:26.230
You came to see me!

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:28.010
I did, Lulala.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.870
I came all this way because 
I wanted to examine your gills,

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:33.620
nictitating membranes, and webbing!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.700
Oh, Doctor!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:35.900
Lulala!

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.630
Somethin' like that could be happenin', or...

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.350
Well done! You get a perfect score, Glenn!

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.740
You really are my best student!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:53.130
Or somethin' like that!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:56.030
Yeah, I'd say it's not impossible to imagine.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.520
That would never happen!

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:02.010
But it might! Look how Dr. Glenn 
treats other girls behind your back!

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:06.350
You do remember when Tisalia ruined your 
attempt at being a villain the other day, right?

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.770
Oh, I'm just teasin'.

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:13.650
Illy.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:17.080
Wh-What is all of this?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.670
Food from my village and the mountains!

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:23.910
Lady Gigas and the rest of my village 
wanted Dr. Glenn to have some!

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:27.040
But we'll never be able to eat all this...

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.260
So, is the doc not here?

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.260
He's on a house call.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.970
That's no fun...

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.530
I'm back, Sapphee! Sorry it took so long.

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:37.430
Doctor!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.560
I've been waiting for you!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.520
Welcome back, Doctor!

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:40.520
Welcome back!

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:40.520
Welcome back!

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:43.250
Oh... I see everyone's here.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.150
Welcome home, Doctor.

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:52.000
You took a while getting back. 
Did something happen?

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:55.640
N-Nothing major... More importantly, 
how are you feeling, Sapphee?

00:16:55.640 --> 00:17:00.670
Oh, I'm doing much better, thanks to 
the intimate treatment you gave me.

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:02.620
Thank goodness.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:05.660
Good Doctor! May I come in yet?

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:07.410
Oh, I'll open up right now.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:12.820
Wha—

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:14.870
What in the world is all this?

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:17.630
Well, some things happened and...

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:22.070
Everyone I kept running into on the 
way home just kept giving me food...

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:25.360
That's how I ended up with all this.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.020
I see.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:31.430
What's all this ruckus?

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:34.770
Lady Skadi! Didn't you return 
to the council for the day?

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.370
I came to see you again, Big Brother.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.290
Here, I brought you a gift. Dragon Dumplings.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.300
Big Brother?

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:45.670
W-Wow! Thank you so much!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.590
Why, they're Lindworm's 
famous Dragon Dumplings!

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:50.410
Hey, Doc!

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.180
Boss... and Memé, and the 
guys from the workshop!

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:59.180
Memé filled us in. We figured it'd be 
more fun drinking with everyone else.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.980
The more the merrier, am I right?

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:03.920
A-As long as it's not any trouble...

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:06.810
It's not any trouble...

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.810
What're we gonna do, Sapphee?

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:12.090
This is just too much food and alcohol...

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:15.820
You heard the boss. 
There's only one solution.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:21.950
Memé is my best apprentice!

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:26.760
Come on, drink up!

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:27.830
Can we, Boss?!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:57.540
Honestly, it's so much work 
fallin' for someone so popular.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.700
Now I can understand how 
terribly you suffer, Sapphee.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.330
In that case, you could always back off.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:08.280
Absolutely not! My crush has just begun!

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:13.030
And yet it appears we have 
another worthy opponent.

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.160
No way! Who's that?

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:30.550
Thank you for everything, Lady Skadi.

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:34.760
Not only did you provide us with wine, 
you even got us some food.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.460
That wasn't my doing.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:39.760
Kunai and my other subordinates 
made a few calls.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.830
Everyone works hard for me.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:49.710
Dr. Glenn, ever since the surgery, 
the world looks slightly different to me.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:55.340
I descended to the surface 
and took on a human form.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:58.610
But... perhaps I hadn't actually 
touched the ground

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:01.030
and truly interacted with others until now.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.930
If you hadn't convinced me,

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:07.770
I may have gone back to heaven 
without getting closer to anyone.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:12.940
Thank you, Big Brother.

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:18.030
Um, I really would prefer it if
you'd call me something else...

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:21.380
I mean, you are clearly 
older than me, Lady Skadi.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:26.840
You say that, but I see that 
smirk on your face, Doctor!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.800
S-Sapphee!

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:33.590
So being called "Good Doctor" wasn't 
enough, and now it's "Big Brother"?

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:36.740
Aren't you getting a bit close...

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:38.860
Glenn Litbeit?

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:41.760
Er, I... really don't know what to do here.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.880
I was sick, you know!

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:46.130
And you took so long to get home!

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:48.400
And when you did, 
you brought everyone with you!

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:51.130
Can't we just have some time alone?!

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:53.260
Sapphee, calm down, please...

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:58.510
Well, to prove that my canker sore 
is better, let me lick your cheek.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:01.240
Why?!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:03.620
What in the world are you saying, Sapphee?!

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.750
That makes no sense whatsoever!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.650
It makes perfect sense!

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:11.240
Please, Doctor! Just a little! Just the tip!

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:18.120
Well, since that's settled, 
I'll be taking Big Brother Glenn.

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:23.840
What exactly has been settled here?!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.550
Even if you are Lady Draconness,
I can't let you do that!

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.020
Ooh, I'm coming, too!

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:30.660
Doctor!

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:32.100
Good Doctor!

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:51.550
<i>The clinic can be found near 
the waterways in Lindworm.</i>

00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:59.030
<i>There resides the young human doctor 
who specializes in treating monsters.</i>

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:01.930
<i>His name is Glenn Litbeit.</i>

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:08.120
<i>This tale about the adventures of this young 
doctor and his friends has only just begun.</i>
